+<section class="wrap hero" aria-labelledby="page-title"><span class="eyebrow">Simple, transparent pricing</span><h1 id="page-title">More flow. Less noise.</h1><p>Bring your team together with chat that keeps work moving. Start free, then grow at your own pace.</p><div class="billing"><span id="monthly-label">Monthly</span><button class="switch" type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-labelledby="monthly-label yearly-label" aria-describedby="saving-label"><span class="knob"></span></button><span id="yearly-label">Yearly</span><span class="save" id="saving-label">Save 20%</span></div></section>
