+<section class="section" id="compare" aria-labelledby="compare-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">The details</span><h2 id="compare-title">A plan for every kind of team.</h2><p>All the essentials, with room to grow.</p></div><div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Feature comparison table" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Features</th><th scope="col">Free</th><th scope="col" class="highlight">Team</th><th scope="col">Business</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Message history</th><td>90 days</td><td class="highlight">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Members</th><td>Up to 10</td><td class="highlight">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audio &amp; video calls</th><td>1:1</td><td class="highlight">Group calls</td><td>Group calls</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Integrations</th><td>3</td><td class="highlight">Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Guest access</th><td>—</td><td class="highlight"><span class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td><td><span class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Advanced security &amp; SSO</th><td>—</td><td class="highlight">—</td><td><span class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Priority support</th><td>—</td><td class="highlight">—</td><td><span class="yes" aria-label="Included">✓</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
+<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span><h2 id="faq-title">Questions, answered.</h2></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p class="answer">Yes. The Free plan is free forever, and you can explore Team features by starting a conversation with our team.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p class="answer">Choose yearly billing and pay once a year. Team and Business cost 20% less than paying month to month. Prices shown are per user, per month, billed yearly.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p class="answer">Absolutely. Upgrade or downgrade whenever your team's needs change. Your team and messages stay together.</p></details><details><summary>What happens if my team grows?</summary><p class="answer">Add members as you grow. Team and Business support unlimited members, and you can switch plans at any time.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help setting things up?</summary><p class="answer">Yes. Our team can help you get started and answer questions. Business plans also include priority support.</p></details></div></div></section>
